# Service Certify

SvelteKit 2 / Svelte 5 practice platform for ServiceNow certification exams. Visual design is **Editorial Architect** (Stitch prototypes), not a generic purple SaaS template.

## Stack

- Frontend: SvelteKit 2, Svelte 5 **runes only**, Tailwind CSS v4, `convex-svelte`
- Backend: Convex at **`src/convex/`** (not repo-root `convex/`). Alias: `$convex` → `src/convex`
- Auth: WorkOS OAuth (Google / Microsoft). Identity is **`workosId`**, never email
- Host: Vercel (`@sveltejs/adapter-vercel`). Node `>=22.11.0`
- Lint: **oxlint** + anti-slop plugin (`npm run lint`). Not ESLint

## Data split (do not invert)

- Exam catalog / domain cards: **static** — `$lib/data/exams.ts`, `$lib/catalog/trackDocSources.ts`
- Practice questions, grading, OAuth→Convex user sync, progress: **Convex** (`PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL`)
- Without Convex the UI still renders from static data. Do not invent client-side answer keys to “fix” empty practice

## Env files (two of them)

- `.env.convex` — committed; Convex CLI (`npm run convex:dev`, seeds) via `--env-file`
- `.env.local` — gitignored; SvelteKit/Vite. Copy `PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL` from `.env.convex`
- Convex dashboard env (not `.env.local`): `ADMIN_EMAILS`, `WORKOS_CLIENT_ID`

## Access model

- Sample practice: public, **≤3 questions**, answers stripped from list queries
- Full mock: **admin role** (`ADMIN_EMAILS` bootstrap), not paid membership. Membership UI is Phase D placeholder
- There is **no `/admin` route tree**. Admin is `users.role === "admin"`

## Never edit / never commit

- `src/convex/_generated/**` (codegen)
- `src/convex/seed/devQuestionBank.private.ts` (gitignored full bank)
- `patches/**` unless intentionally upgrading adapter-vercel
- `.svelte-kit/`, `build/`, `.vercel/`

## Commands

- App: `npm run dev` (http://localhost:5173)
- Convex: `npm run convex:dev`
- Check: `npm run check` · Tests: `npm test` · Lint: `npm run lint`
- Seed: `npm run seed:dev` then `npm run seed:dev:questions` (refuses stub bank)

